05:36.462 --> 05:38.089
You have everything you need?

05:38.172 --> 05:41.008
No. But I've made the best
out of what we have.

05:43.219 --> 05:46.722
Bernard and Jin?
— they're both excellent shots.

05:46.806 --> 05:48.641
And highly motivated.

05:50.309 --> 05:52.937
