12:06.894 --> 12:09.104
Why are you breaking radio silence?

12:09.188 --> 12:11.774
One of them's down here.
— I'm sorry. What?

12:11.857 --> 12:15.569
We've got him tied up, but he's here.
One of them swam down here.

12:15.653 --> 12:18.072
