And for all we know, it worked.

18:51.256 --> 18:53.925
It's gonna be ok.
Everything's gonna be all right.

18:55.761 --> 18:58.305
Let's just keep moving, ok?

19:09.316 --> 19:11.276
It's ok. Let's go.

19:19.117 --> 19:23.622
