19:50.816 --> 19:53.151
And only three people know it:

19:53.235 --> 19:55.737
Me, her and Ben.

20:01.576 --> 20:04.704
Well, I guess I won't need the code,

20:04.788 --> 20:08.959
since this entire station's
gonna be flooded, anwvay.

20:11.420 --> 20:13.088
I turn off your little jammer,

20:13.171 --> 20:15.507
