what happens to you?

20:32.065 --> 20:34.276
- What?
- [Friendly] They're all dead!

20:34.359 --> 20:38.321
Diane, Ivan, all of them, dead!
Shephard and his people, they're gone!

20:38.405 --> 20:40.115
