— who do you have?

21:11.188 --> 21:13.732
Jarrah, Kwon and the dentist.

21:13.815 --> 21:15.025
Fifififi' uuuun

21:17.319 --> 21:18.987
what? — you want them to answer?

21:19.070 --> 21:20.489
Kill Kwon. Do it now.

21:20.572 --> 21:22.115
