22:53.081 --> 22:54.833
Not we, Richard. Me.

22:54.916 --> 22:57.752
You're going to take everyone
to the temple as planned.

22:57.836 --> 23:01.006
Now might not be the best time
to go tromping off on your own.

23:01.089 --> 23:02.173
And why not?

23:02.257 --> 23:03.883
People are asking questions.

23:03.967 --> 23:08.054
About leaving home, about
what happened to Locke, about Jacob.

23:09.222 --> 23:13.643
Not to mention the rumor that everyone
who went down to the beach is dead.

23:13.727 --> 23:15.228
They're not all dead.

23:21.192 --> 23:22.444
Where are you going?

23:22.527 --> 23:24.279
Hello, Alex.

23:24.904 --> 23:26.781
I asked where you were going.

23:26.865 --> 23:28.658
I thought I might go for a walk.

23:28.742 --> 23:31.870
