23:35.165 --> 23:37.459
All right. — what?

23:37.542 --> 23:39.210
I said, all right.

23:39.294 --> 23:41.379
In fact, I think it's a good idea.

23:42.505 --> 23:44.799
You do wanna see Karl again.
Don't you?

23:47.636 --> 23:50.347
Get your pack.
I'm leaving in ten minutes.

23:54.559 --> 23:57.103
There's 40 of them.
And you're alone.

23:57.187 --> 24:00.231
They're gonna do whatever it takes
to get off the island.

24:00.315 --> 24:03.068
What do you think's
gonna happen when you get there?

24:04.486 --> 24:06.196
I'm gonna talk them out of it.

24:35.225 --> 24:39.437
Something's wrong.
— lots of things are wrong, Kate.

24:39.562 --> 24:43.233
Jin, Bernard, Sayid,
they should've caught up to us by now.

24:43.775 --> 24:45.860
